[sysmode]
  <sysmode>
 switch adsl mode to rfc2662 vdsl mode to tr129
 xpon mode switch-to profile-mode
 voice-spec set vag-num 8
 protocol support h248
 system ex-mode backup 
 system workscene msan 
 router mode basic 
#
